 More Images 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/4c90b3ba33b0af9aa0be82c53adc1995/v0/medium/lodha_malabar_wing_a_and_b-malabar_hill-mumbai-lodha_group.jpeg)\n![Lodha Malabar Wing A And B Elevation 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/012c1500/53526ef607447689d912250711e881f1/v0/medium.jpeg)\n![Lodha Malabar Wing A And B Living Area 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/012c1500/a84f41ba86654954abc14e595a2d841f/v0/medium.jpeg)\n\n## Lodha Malabar Wing A And B Top Amenities\n\n![]()\n\n## Lodha Malabar Wing A And B Specifications\n\n### Floor & Counter\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/floorCounterTab.65d21b4c.svg)\n\n### Fitting\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/fittingTab.01cbbe4c.svg)\n\n### Wall & Ceiling\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/wallsCeilingTab.31601368.svg)\n\n### Lodha Malabar Wing A And B Ratings & Reviews Malabar Hill\n\n## Lodha Malabar Wing A And B Ratings & Reviews\n\n### Ratings based on features\n\n4.4/5\n\n4.4/5\n\n4.3/5\n\n4.1/5\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  1 year ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nthe area is most prestigious and upscale localities in Mumbai, offering stunning views of the Arabian sea. the neighbourhood is quiet, clean and surrounded by greenery, which is are yaar to find in the bustling City. the location is also prime, with easy access to the cities top schools, hospitals and business district, making daily life convenient.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nthe area is fully crowded by traffic in evening time so here the noise pollution is increases due to many vehicle on the road. pollution levels are also increasesread more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  1 year ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nThis place offers unparalleled convenience. Its proximity to south Mumbai's commercial and cultural hotspots has made work and leisure activities easily accessible over the years. The area's central location is a significant advantage for navigation the city. babulnath provides a surprisingly serene environment. The presence of green spaces and the relatively quieter streets compared to other parts of mumbai.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThe exclusively of babulnath comes with a high cost of living. Property prices and daily expenses in this upscale area are significantly higher, which can be a financial strain over the years. The premium nature of the neighborhood has been a considerable factor in the cost of living. The narrow streets and heavy traffic can make commuting challenging and time consuming.read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nVerdant Malabar Hill is an upscale residential area known for the Hanging Gardens, a hillside park with sea views and hedges sculpted into animal shapes. At the Walkeshwar temple complex, Banganga tanread more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThis place is best for home. I think this place is very beautiful for you. It has all the facilities.read more\n\n![]()\n\nTenant |  4 years ago\n\nThe area is located in proximity to hanging garden. It is full of lush greenery. Ample parking space is available for the residents. Police patrolling is done on a regular basis. No power issues in the area. Also, water supply is good.\n\n![]()\n\nBroker |  4 years ago\n\nNo power issues in the area. Also, water supply is good. No parking space issues. Shops, hospitals, schools, markets, etc., are available near the locality. Metro station is a bit far though. There are many green zones and maintained parks.\n\n8 Reviews\n\n## Price Trends for Malabar Hill\n\n+\n\nADD MORE\n\nto compare\n\n## Property Registery Records of Lodha Malabar Wing A And B\n\nGovernment Registered Transactions & Property Rates\n\n### Recent Registries in Lodha Malabar Wing A And B\n\nData Source : Maharashtra Government\n\n| Date | Agreement Price | Area(sq.ft) | Rate/sq.ft | Flat & Floor No. | Tower | Transaction Type |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 6 Sep, 2026 | [View Price