aterview. \n\n### How many towers in Lodha Waterview?\n\nLodha Waterview has a total of 1 towers in different unit configurations.\n\n### What is the RERA number of Lodha Waterview?\n\nThe RERA number of Lodha Waterview is P51900055626. You can easily find it on RERA official website.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 23 August 2026\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n*   [Properties for Sale in Lodha Waterview](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-lodha-waterview-3bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Properties for Sale in Lodha Waterview](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-lodha-waterview-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nQuick Links\n\n*   [Lodha Waterview Photos Videos](https://www.magicbricks.com/lodha-waterview-photo-videos-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343430393335)\n*   [Lodha Waterview Amenities](https://www.magicbricks.com/lodha-waterview-amenities-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343430393335)\n\nNew Launched Projects\n\n*   [Runwal Malabar](https://www.magicbricks.com/runwal-malabar-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343435353935)\n*   [Aurum Girnar](https://www.magicbricks.com/aurum-girnar-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343431303133)\n*   [Gokul Nakashtra](https://www.magicbricks.com/gokul-nakashtra-virar-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343232323939)\n*   [Chandak Unicorn](https://www.magicbricks.com/chandak-unicorn-andheri-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235323832313237)\n*   [Dhuleva Seven](https://www.magicbricks.com/dhuleva-seven-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343330393733)\n*   [Satellite Sesen](https://www.magicbricks.com/satellite-sesen-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235313533323033)\n*   [Kalpataru Azuro](https://www.magicbricks.com/kalpataru-azuro-nepean-sea-road-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343330313333)\n*   [HM Central Park](https://www.magicbricks.com/hm-central-park-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333336313939)\n*   [Lodha Seamont](https://www.magicbricks.com/lodha-seamont-walkeshwar-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235313236303831)\n*   [Shapoorji Pallonji The Odyssey](https://www.