y?trk=linkedin-tc_auth-button_privacy-policy), and [Cookie Policy](/legal/cookie-policy?trk=linkedin-tc_auth-button_cookie-policy).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n# Lodha Developers Acquires ₹106.12 Cr Malabar Hill Land\n\n![View profile for Salim Merchant]()\n\nLodha Developers strengthens its ultra-premium stronghold in South Mumbai with a landmark ₹106.12 Cr development rights acquisition in iconic Malabar Hill!\nIn a strategic masterstroke, Lodha has secured development rights for a rare 4.3-acre (17,403 sq m) contiguous land parcel owned by the Sorabji Kanga Charity Trust in Malabar Hill. The agreement was executed on 7 January 2026.\nDeal at a glance (verified from registration documents):\nConsideration: ₹106.12 crore\nLodha’s share: 57.5% of total FSI → 5,017 sq m RERA carpet area + 150 car parking spaces\nTrust’s share: 42.5% revenue + independent building with equivalent ~54,000 sq ft RERA carpet area\nRegistered market value: ₹621.71 crore\nStamp duty paid by Lodha: ₹37.42 crore\nAdditional commitments: ₹125 crore security deposit + ₹40 crore bank guarantee\nUnder DCPR 2034: 38,990.48 sq m handed over to MHADA (rehab component)\nEstimated project potential: ~₹2,800 crore GDV\nSite features: 6 bungalows + residential tower + chawl (one of the last large contiguous parcels in SoBo)\nMalabar Hill Market Momentum\n(2025 data – Square Yards & Propstack):\n41 residential transactions | Total value ₹1,038 crore\nQ4 2025 average rate: ₹1,37,500/sq ft (sharp rise from ₹98,566/sq ft in Q4 2024 – +39% YoY)\nAlso making headlines: Just last month (registered 11 Feb 2026), Lodha signed a ₹364.80 crore JDA with Sahana Group for 10.26 acres (41,526 sq m) in the high-growth Parel–Sewri corridor (Lodha ~67% share, 5-year construction timeline).\nThese moves come as Mumbai’s luxury segment continues its stellar run:\nH1 2025 luxury sales (>₹10 Cr homes): ₹14,750 crore (+11% YoY)\nMMR residential outlook 2026: +6-8% sales volume growth, inventory at historic low of 1–1.1 years (ICRA)\nSouth Mumbai premium micro-markets remain the gold standard for HNIs and lifestyle upgraders\nLodha – India’s second-largest listed developer – continues to demonstrate unmatched execution in high-barrier, ultra-luxury addresses where land is scarce and pricing power is strongest.\nDoes this signal the beginning of Malabar Hill’s next luxury renaissance, with branded developers driving the next wave of landmark projects?👇Comment below👇\nFOLLOW [Salim Merchant](https://in.linkedin.com/in/tohfa?trk=public_post-text) To stay ahead in Real Estate Updates\n(Lodha Malabar Hill, South Mumbai luxury, ₹106 Cr development rights, Malabar Hill redevelopment, Parel Sewri JDA, Mumbai ultra-luxury 2026, Lodha Developers expansion, SoBo premium housing)\n[#LodhaDevelopers](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flodhadevelopers&trk=public_post-text) [#MalabarHill](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmalabarhill&trk=public_post-text) [#SouthMumbai](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsouthmumbai&trk=public_post-text) [#UltraLuxuryRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fultraluxuryrealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#MumbaiRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbairealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#PremiumHousing](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpremiumhousing&trk=public_post-text) [#RealEstateIndia](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frealestateindia&trk=public_post-text) [#Redevelopment](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fredevelopment&trk=public_post-text) [#MarketMomentum](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmarketmomentum&trk=public_post-text) [#tohfaproperty](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftohfaproperty&trk=public_post-text)\n\n![No alternative text description for this image]()\n\n\n![]()\n![]()\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis deal is a masterclass in Capital Efficiency over traditional land banking.\nBy structuring this as a development rights acquisition with a 57.5% share rather than an outright purchase, Lodha secures a massive ₹2,800 Cr GDV for a relatively low upfront consideration of ₹106 Cr. This \"asset-light\" strategy is crucial when Malabar Hill rates have surged 39% YoY to ₹1,37,500/sq ft.\nWith inventory at a historic low of 1–1.1 years, the winner isn't just the one with the best land, but the one with the fastest, most liquidity-preserving execution.\n\nMany Congratulations 🎉 Sir\n\nImpressive milestone, sir! 🌟 Lodha continues to set benchmarks in Mumbai’s ultra-luxury real estate market.🌐 [www.whiteshedsolutions.com](http://www.whiteshedsolutions.com?trk=public_post_comment-text)\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fposts%2Ftohfa_lodhadevelopers-malabarhill-southmumbai-activity-7433125756249067521-I6aZ&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\n## More Relevant Posts\n\nGodrej Properties Acquired 11.36 Acres in Sector 63A: A Billion-Dollar Strategic Move 🏗️\nThe high-stakes game of Gurugram real estate has witnessed another major move. Godrej Properties has officially acquired 11.36 acres in Sector 63A on Golf Course Extension Road. For investors, developers, and real estate professionals, this is far more than a simple land transaction. It clearly signals where Gurugram’s residential and economic center of gravity is shifting for the next decade.\nThe Hard Numbers Behind the Deal\n• Acquisition Cost: Market estimates suggest the land purchase value is close to ₹1,000 crore.\n• Revenue Potential: The upcoming project is expected to generate over ₹4,500 crore in revenue.\n• Strategic Vision: The development is planned as a high-end residential landmark, strengthening Sector 63A as one of NCR’s most premium luxury micro-markets.\nThe “League of Extraordinary Developers”\nWhat makes this acquisition particularly interesting is the cluster of institutional developers already present in this corridor. In the last few years, several top developers have strategically invested here.\n• DLF Limited dominates nearby Sector 63 with DLF The Arbour, a 25-acre ultra-luxury development that established new price benchmarks for the area.\n• Oberoi Realty is entering the NCR market with a 15-acre luxury project in Sector 58, bringing its Mumbai-style ultra-premium positioning.\n• Sobha Limited has strengthened its presence with Sobha Crescent (Sobha 63A), a high-rise luxury project known for international construction standards.\n• Max Estates Limited secured 7.25 acres in Sector 59 with a projected development value of nearly ₹3,000 crore, aligned with its LiveWell residential philosophy.\n• M3M India continues to dominate the Golf Course Extension skyline with multiple luxury towers and branded residential developments.\nThe corridor offers strong advantages:\n• Rapid infrastructure development\n• Seamless connectivity to Cyber City and major business hubs\n• Growing concentration of high-net-worth residential communities\n• Strong demand for luxury and premium housing\nAll these factors are transforming Sector 63A from a developing pocket into one of the most promising luxury destinations in Gurugram.\nMarket Context: Gurugram Real Estate\nThe broader Gurugram market also remains extremely strong. Current estimates place the average property price in Gurgaon around ₹13,383 per sq ft. However, premium sectors such as 63A, 58, and Golf Course Extension Road already command a significant luxury premium well above the city average.\nThe big question now is not whether Golf Course Extension Road will grow ,but how quickly it will evolve into one of India’s most prestigious residential stretches.\n\n![No alternative text description for this image]()\n\n\n![]()\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Favinash-kumar-9ab73527b_godrej-properties-acquired-1136-acres-in-activity-7436134477908807680-Idb9&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\n1,662 followers\n\n[Birla Estates](https://in.linkedin.com/company/birla-estates?trk=public_post-text) eyes Rs 1700 from redevelopment project in Mumbai’s Khar\nThe company will redevelop Anmol Co-operative Housing Society and Bhartiya Bhavan Co-operative Housing Society in Khar West, Mumbai’s Western Suburbs under a joint redevelopment arrangement with Parinee Real Estate Builders.\n[Ananya Birla](https://in.linkedin.com/in/ananyabirla?trk=public_post-text) | [Jithendran K. T.](https://in.linkedin.com/in/jithendran-k-t-54baa149?trk=public_post-text) | [Aditya Birla Real Estate Limited (Formerly Century Textiles and Industries Limited)](https://in.linkedin.com/company/century-textiles-&-inds-ltd?trk=public_post-text) | [Parinee Group](https://www.linkedin.com/company/parineegroup?trk=public_post-text)\n[#RealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#Mumbai](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbai&trk=public_post-text) [#Residential](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fresidential&trk=public_post-text) [#LuxuryHousing](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fluxuryhousing&trk=public_post-text) [#PremiumResidences](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpremiumresidences&trk=public_post-text) [#KharWest](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkharwest&trk=public_post-text)\n[https://lnkd.in/gXk-4UTq](https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnkd%2Ein%2FgXk-4UTq&urlhash=XLl0&trk=public_post-text)\n\n![Birla Estates Eyes Rs 1,700 Cr Revenue from Khar West Project]()\n\n\n![]()\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Frealtyninfra_birla-estates-eyes-rs-1700-cr-revenue-from-activity-7443243720046678016--uJm&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\nBirla Estates debuts in Mumbai redevelopment market with 2.9 lakh sq ft Khar West luxury residential project [#BirlaEstates](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbirlaestates&trk=public_post-text) [#ABREL](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fabrel&trk=public_post-text) [#MumbaiRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbairealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#KharWest](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkharwest&trk=public_post-text) [#AdityadBirlaRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fadityadbirlarealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#MumbaiRedevelopment](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbairedevelopment&trk=public_post-text) [#ParineeGroup](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fparineegroup&trk=public_post-text) [#LuxuryHomes](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fluxuryhomes&trk=public_post-text) [#IndianRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Findianrealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#MumbaiProperty](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbaiproperty&trk=public_post-text) [#Mumbai](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbai&trk=public_post-text)\n\n![Birla Estates debuts in Mumbai redevelopment market with 2.9 lakh sq ft Khar West luxury residential project]()\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Fpallavi-madhiraju-54053a87_birla-estates-debuts-in-mumbai-redevelopment-activity-7443336501784031232-6G8H&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\n169 followers\n\nIndia’s real estate sector continues to demonstrate strong momentum, particularly in the luxury and large-scale development segments. Recent announcements in Mumbai and Noida highlight how leading developers are expanding portfolios and investing in premium residential projects to meet evolving demand.\nRaymond Realty has signed definitive documents for a new residential joint development in Kandivali, Mumbai. The project carries an estimated Gross Development Value (GDV) of approximately ₹3,000 crore and marks the company’s seventh such development in the city. With this addition, Raymond Realty’s overall real estate portfolio now approaches a GDV of nearly ₹43,000 crore, reinforcing its growing presence in Mumbai’s competitive residential market.\nAt the same time, County Group has launched Clove County, a luxury residential development in Sector 151 along the Noida–Greater Noida Expressway. The project represents an investment exceeding ₹1,200 crore and spans approximately five acres. Designed as a premium living environment, the development will feature 226 high-end residences across three towers.\nThe residences are designed for large-format luxury living, offering approximately 4,077 sq ft 4BHK units and expansive 5BHK configurations ranging from about 5,310 to 6,417 sq ft. Pricing for these luxury homes is expected to range between ₹10 crore and ₹18 crore, positioning the project among the premium residential offerings in the region. The development is located on a land parcel acquired in 2025 for approximately ₹473 crore and spans nearly 11 lakh sq ft.\nThese developments illustrate two key trends shaping India’s real estate landscape: the rise of luxury housing demand in major urban corridors and the increasing use of joint development models to unlock land value in high-density markets.\nAs infrastructure improves and buyer aspirations evolve, the luxury segment in cities like Mumbai and Noida continues to attract both end users and long-term investors.\n[#xproptech](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fxproptech&trk=public_post-text) [#RealEstateIndia](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frealestateindia&trk=public_post-text) [#LuxuryRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fluxuryrealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#MumbaiRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbairealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#NoidaRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fnoidarealestate&trk=public_post-text)\n\n![No alternative text description for this image]()\n\n\n![]()\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Fxproptech_xproptech-realestateindia-luxuryrealestate-activity-7437059251778514944-EkN0&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\n36,070 followers\n\nCounty Group launches ultra-luxury housing project in Noida, to invest ₹1,200 crore\nReal estate developer County Group has launched an ultra-luxury residential project in Noida’s Sector 151 and plans to invest over ₹1,200 crore in its development. Apartments in the project are priced between ₹10 crore and ₹18 crore, the company said in a statement on March 9.\nThe project, called Clove County, is located along the Noida-Greater Noida Expressway and will feature 226 apartments spread across three towers on a 5-acre parcel.\n“Unlike conventional gated communities where buildings dominate the site, Clove County has been planned with much of the ground plan kept open. With over 60% open space, the project hosts landscaped greens, water bodies, pedestrian walkways, and a greenhouse, among other amenities.\nThe focus of the project is on exclusive large residences with a calm residential environment emphasising open spaces, nature, aqua and privacy,” Amit Modi , Director, County Group said.\n[#realestate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#property](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fproperty&trk=public_post-text) [#housing](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhousing&trk=public_post-text) [#residential](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fresidential&trk=public_post-text) [#demand](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdemand&trk=public_post-text) [#growth](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgrowth&trk=public_post-text) [#projects](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fprojects&trk=public_post-text) [#newlaunches](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fnewlaunches&trk=public_post-text) [#hnwis](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhnwis&trk=public_post-text) [#nris](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fnris&trk=public_post-text) [#luxuryhomes](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fluxuryhomes&trk=public_post-text) [#homebuyers](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhomebuyers&trk=public_post-text) [#investments](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finvestments&trk=public_post-text) [#investors](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finvestors&trk=public_post-text) [#realestatedevelopers](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frealestatedevelopers&trk=public_post-text) [#realestateagents](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frealestateagents&trk=public_post-text) [THE REALTY NEWS](https://in.linkedin.com/company/therealtynews?trk=public_post-text) [County Group](https://in.linkedin.com/company/county-group?trk=public_post-text)\n[https://lnkd.in/gdeNhuES](https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnkd%2Ein%2FgdeNhuES&urlhash=ktZm&trk=public_post-text)\n\n![County Group launches ultra-luxury housing project in Noida, to invest ₹1,200 crore]()\n\n\n![]()\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Ftherealtynews_county-group-launches-ultra-luxury-housing-activity-7436994774450081793-ckcU&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\n60,144 followers\n\nArkade Developers has launched Arkade Evoke, a ₹230 crore luxury residential project in Goregaon West, Mumbai, offering 2 and 3 BHK apartments with metro connectivity as a key demand driver.\nRead more: [https://trib.al/4yycUkY](https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftrib%2Eal%2F4yycUkY&urlhash=kNGt&trk=public_post-text)\n\n![Arkade Developers launches ₹230 crore luxury project in Goregaon West, stock closes up 1.93%]()\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Fhindubusinessline_arkade-developers-launches-230-crore-luxury-activity-7442578555990863872-eRZ5&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\nArvind SmartSpaces signs its first Mumbai apartment redevelopment in Santacruz (West). Here’s what it means for the company’s MMR strategy. Read more. [#ArvindSmartSpaces](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Farvindsmartspaces&trk=public_post-text) [#ARVSMART](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Farvsmart&trk=public_post-text) [#MumbaiRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmumbairealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#SocietyRedevelopment](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsocietyredevelopment&trk=public_post-text) [#MMR](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmmr&trk=public_post-text) [#Santacruz](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsantacruz&trk=public_post-text) [#LalbhaiGroup](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flalbhaigroup&trk=public_post-text) [#IndianRealEstate](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Findianrealestate&trk=public_post-text) [#PropertyInvestment](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpropertyinvestment&trk=public_post-text) [#PriyanshKapoor](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpriyanshkapoor&trk=public_post-text) [Arvind SmartSpaces](https://in.linkedin.com/company/arvind-smartspaces?trk=public_post-text)\n\n![Arvind SmartSpaces (NSE: ARVSMART) enters Mumbai society redevelopment with Rs. 300cr Santacruz project]()\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Fbusiness-news-today-reporter-2947182_arvind-smartspaces-nse-arvsmart-enters-activity-7443245095744790528-3v64&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\nBhumika Realty Commences Construction of &apos;The Icon&apos; in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony\nBhumika Realty, North India’s leading real estate firm, has commenced construction of its mixed-use development, The Icon, on the Delhi–Mathura Road in Faridabad. Marking the milestone, the company also performed a Bhoomi Pujan ceremony at the project site.   Bhumika Realty Commences Construction of ‘The Icon’ in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony The project had earlier secured institutional funding of Rs. 170 crore raised from BGO in partnership with Aditya Birla Sun Life AMC. Over 81,156 sq. ft. of retail space was leased within two months of the launch. “The Bhoomi Pujan and commencement of construction represent a significant milestone for The Icon. Securing the funding reflects the confidence of the country’s leading institutional lenders, and the fact that over 81,156 sq. ft. was leased in a short span after launch speaks about stakeholders’ confidence both in the project and in the company, as well as in Faridabad’s growth trajectory,” said Uddhav Poddar, CMD, Bhumika Group. The ceremony, titled “Pragati ka Prarambh,” brought together all the project’s stakeholders. Spread across approximately 5 acres, The Icon forms part of Bhumika Group’s Rs. 700-crore mixed-use development in Faridabad. The project will feature premium retail and entertainment spaces along with 88 low-density 3BHK + study residences, designed to offer an integrated lifestyle environment. A hotel tower with serviced suites is also planned in a later phase of development. Brands that have already taken space include Apple, Adidas, Levi’s, Raymond, BBQ Company, Looks Salon, Samsung, Vivo, Metro Shoes, Mochi, Park Avenue, ColorPlus, Mufti, Linen Club, The Sleep Company, Bluetokai, Honey & Dough and Geetanjali Salon. Other brands joining the project include Clovia, Intimissimi, Shree, Palmonas, Delsey Paris, Fila, Tossin Pizza, The Chocolate Room, Fredo Bakehouse, Ethera Diamonds and Trends Footwear. Strategically located on the Delhi–Mathura Road, the project is expected to benefit from improving regional connectivity, including the upcoming Faridabad–Noida–Gurugram (FNG) Expressway and enhanced access to the Noida International Airport in Jewar. Bhumika Realty Commences Construction of &apos;The Icon&apos; in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony\n\n![Bhumika Realty Commences Construction of &apos;The Icon&apos; in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony]()\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Fgovindchoudhary1996_bhumika-realty-commences-construction-of-activity-7440321947399446528-C1zm&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\n384 followers\n\nBhumika Realty Commences Construction of &apos;The Icon&apos; in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony\nBhumika Realty, North India’s leading real estate firm, has commenced construction of its mixed-use development, The Icon, on the Delhi–Mathura Road in Faridabad. Marking the milestone, the company also performed a Bhoomi Pujan ceremony at the project site.   Bhumika Realty Commences Construction of ‘The Icon’ in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony The project had earlier secured institutional funding of Rs. 170 crore raised from BGO in partnership with Aditya Birla Sun Life AMC. Over 81,156 sq. ft. of retail space was leased within two months of the launch. “The Bhoomi Pujan and commencement of construction represent a significant milestone for The Icon. Securing the funding reflects the confidence of the country’s leading institutional lenders, and the fact that over 81,156 sq. ft. was leased in a short span after launch speaks about stakeholders’ confidence both in the project and in the company, as well as in Faridabad’s growth trajectory,” said Uddhav Poddar, CMD, Bhumika Group. The ceremony, titled “Pragati ka Prarambh,” brought together all the project’s stakeholders. Spread across approximately 5 acres, The Icon forms part of Bhumika Group’s Rs. 700-crore mixed-use development in Faridabad. The project will feature premium retail and entertainment spaces along with 88 low-density 3BHK + study residences, designed to offer an integrated lifestyle environment. A hotel tower with serviced suites is also planned in a later phase of development. Brands that have already taken space include Apple, Adidas, Levi’s, Raymond, BBQ Company, Looks Salon, Samsung, Vivo, Metro Shoes, Mochi, Park Avenue, ColorPlus, Mufti, Linen Club, The Sleep Company, Bluetokai, Honey & Dough and Geetanjali Salon. Other brands joining the project include Clovia, Intimissimi, Shree, Palmonas, Delsey Paris, Fila, Tossin Pizza, The Chocolate Room, Fredo Bakehouse, Ethera Diamonds and Trends Footwear. Strategically located on the Delhi–Mathura Road, the project is expected to benefit from improving regional connectivity, including the upcoming Faridabad–Noida–Gurugram (FNG) Expressway and enhanced access to the Noida International Airport in Jewar. Bhumika Realty Commences Construction of &apos;The Icon&apos; in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony\n\n![Bhumika Realty Commences Construction of &apos;The Icon&apos; in Faridabad; Performs Bhoomi Pujan Ceremony]()\n\n\n\n\n\nTo view or add a comment, [sign in](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Fpeopletalky_bhumika-realty-commences-construction-of-activity-7440321929326260224-W0jE&trk=public_post_feed-cta-banner-cta)\n\n![](https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5616AQEOwZTeGBDqhw/profile-displaybackgroundimage-shrink_200_800/B56Z0IjisUJMAY-/0/1773965028946?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=1_QxGZx8ZAYZxNE4pLyb-g0iQmpc-GhVfffkiZkMvqM)\n\n5,654 followers\n\n## More from this author\n\n![]()\n\n### BUSINESS BAY 102-DOWNTOWN.\n\n## Explore content categories\n\n## Sign in to view more content\n\nCreate your free account or sign in to continue your search\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nor\n\nNew to LinkedIn? [Join now](https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fposts%2Ftohfa_lodhadevelopers-malabarhill-southmumbai-activity-7433125756249067521-I6aZ&trk=public_post_contextual-sign-in-modal_join-link)\n\nBy clicking Continue to join or sign i